Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:06.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:17.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:26.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:33.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:40.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:48.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:54.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:02.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:09.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:20.64,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好担心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为戈薇再也不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不好好的跟戈薇道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两人是怎么搞定的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 八成是 戈薇姑娘愿意妥协吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,允许犬夜叉和桔梗劈腿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不可置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇居然能忍受这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉太会钻牛角尖了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在穷追猛打我想不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他从平常就没从容过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.21,0:02:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他也有点不安吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第49话 琥珀失去的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是奈落的城的遗迹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留着些许奈落的瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.35,0:03:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连点痕迹都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的有座城才是怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得也是 现在回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前也是把我们 诱骗到假的城里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时看到的城是幻觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落之城的确曾经在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 找到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家父的铠甲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候 我们这些驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被诱骗到奈落城里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我也来…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是 家父与同伴惨遭杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:13.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手的人 是我的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子受奈落所操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:38.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸首就埋在庭院的一角
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能让令尊与大家的遗骨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弃置在这种不祥之地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想把他们 带到适当的地点好好供奉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果说这里就是奈落的城
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城中的那些人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚那 受奈落所控制的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会也跟着城堡一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不会被野狗挖出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.35,0:05:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时就请各位安眠于此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会在我们的村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的为各位造墓的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然村子里已经没有人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还有我与琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两人可以守着坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子 手艺真不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:33.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.27,0:06:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的看得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还让你帮忙砍柴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.41,0:06:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你也累了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到屋里喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 有想起什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是自己从哪来之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最起码该知道自己的名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在这个城附近的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:13.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概十天前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人见大人的城仿佛失踪般
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失的无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天就发现你倒在旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是经历什么很可怕的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会什么都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没关系 别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:37.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对对 在你想起来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢怎样都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 还有这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量多吃点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:08:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我似乎曾在那里待过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老公公 老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以千万不要出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们这段时间的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是从城里逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天 城消失的晚上…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.09,0:08:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经没有活下去的必要了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到你父亲跟同伴的身边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫…琥珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很近了 就在森林那一带
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的目的也是四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 把埋在你体内的 四魂之玉碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那妖怪想夺走 琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀的性命全靠 埋在体内的四魂碎片维系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片一旦被取出…他就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被奈落控制了心智…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在奈落的城里才对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手腕受伤了 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我以前见过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从城里逃走前的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落也不记得？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:13.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:18.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经没有活下去的必要了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到你父亲跟同伴的身边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 那就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:29.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子一定是在演戏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过看起来不像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是 以前出现在 我们面前的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛被抽走魂魄的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们两人独处不要紧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为珊瑚说想和他独处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师的村落？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:12:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们以前住在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我也能驱逐妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见习的程度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微休息一下 待会还得工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也准备一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经十一岁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也差不多该参与实战了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪真的会吐出火或毒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们驱除的 通常只是大蛇或大蜘蛛之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最可怕的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那些伪装成人形的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是被那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到四魂之玉的话就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是 被奈落叫去的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好是琥珀第一次上阵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就你所知的 请全部告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛昔日的琥珀般…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖巧而有点胆小
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点点慢慢的回想就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为今后我们会一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得不太好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是姐弟呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从奈落的手里逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扁他两三拳不就现出原形了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有这么简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这是不是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昔日最疼爱的弟弟已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是陷阱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:32.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚会大受打击的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为奈落 最喜欢玩弄人的感情了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.59,0:14:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不说的话 我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等不要这样子 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是…关于琥珀的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的陷阱不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是想要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我除了相信还能怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的技俩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若不是我们及时赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片被抽出来话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟就会真的死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:23.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 这就是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好像因为 自己在这里的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而害那个温柔的人遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能留在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是太疼弟弟才分不清道理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆 你懂什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好给我认清现实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.65,0:15:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且本来就是犬夜叉你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是一大群
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们难道是针对琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的气息移动了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须要保护琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们将琥珀藏起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想装蒜 他是奈落养的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀那家伙竟然趁乱逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片还在他身上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是来带他回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也真是小题大作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过想要四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就带这么庞大的阵仗来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说目标是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过没了那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体就丢给他姐姐珊瑚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么追来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的目标是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不要再离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要对我这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一的亲弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 琥珀交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去阻止它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你一定要活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲到那个洞里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在犬夜叉他们来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 珊瑚很强的 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你还没想起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚是你姐姐的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得好怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚被迫和你分开后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段时间一直很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然她平常很坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有时也会露出落寞的神情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以琥珀回来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以和她在一起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话 你就能想起她的一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能想起那个人的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.34,0:21:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:37.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么可怕的东西 我非想起来不可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉好慢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔之矢用光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.69,0:22:29.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:40.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:48.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:52.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:56.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:23:03.56,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:11.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:18.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.58,0:23:26.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:33.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:48.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记忆被消除的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍然受奈落的操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.35,0:23:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实行奈落命令杀害戈薇的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚知道这件事情之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定杀了琥珀然后再自尽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现是陷阱而拼命的 消灭毒虫与妖怪的弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.93,0:24:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点去阻止珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.74,0:24:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张脸绝不会自心底消失
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
